{"term":{"label":"愛","occurrences":3,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"4B","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii","title":"離婁下","description":"孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"人","id":"人"},{"form":"仁","id":"仁"},{"form":"反","id":"反"},{"form":"君","id":"君"},{"form":"君子","id":"君子"},{"form":"從","id":"從"},{"form":"心","id":"心"},{"form":"必","id":"必"},{"form":"愛","id":"愛"},{"form":"由","id":"由"},{"form":"異","id":"異"},{"form":"義","id":"義"},{"form":"自","id":"自"},{"form":"舜","id":"舜"},{"form":"良","id":"良"},{"form":"行","id":"行"}],"edges":[{"weight":0.5520685823000399,"source":"人","target":"心"},{"weight":1.6506808709681495,"source":"人","target":"異"},{"weight":1.6506808709681495,"source":"人","target":"愛"},{"weight":0.9575336904082041,"source":"人","target":"舜"},{"weight":0.5520685823000399,"source":"人","target":"由"},{"weight":0.9575336904082041,"source":"人","target":"從"},{"weight":1.6506808709681495,"source":"人","target":"良"},{"weight":0.9444616088408515,"source":"仁","target":"君"},{"weight":2.243744592971112,"source":"仁","target":"由"},{"weight":2.426066149765067,"source":"仁","target":"義"},{"weight":1.6376087894007967,"source":"仁","target":"行"},{"weight":0.8574502318512216,"source":"仁","target":"君子"},{"weight":1.550597412411167,"source":"仁","target":"心"},{"weight":2.649209701079277,"source":"仁","target":"愛"},{"weight":1.1451323043030026,"source":"仁","target":"必"},{"weight":0.8574502318512216,"source":"仁","target":"反"},{"weight":1.262915339959386,"source":"仁","target":"自"},{"weight":1.8225311278948086,"source":"自","target":"君子"},{"weight":2.3333567516607996,"source":"自","target":"反"},{"weight":1.7047480922384253,"source":"自","target":"必"},{"weight":0.6931471805599453,"source":"必","target":"行"},{"weight":1.992430164690206,"source":"必","target":"反"},{"weight":1.2992829841302609,"sou